  "name": {
   "zh": "面部动作 · SMIRK",
   "en": "Face Motion · SMIRK"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "SMIRK 从单目画面解出三维人脸，面部几何能忠实还原极端、不对称和细微的表情。这张卡交付带表情形变的 FLAME 头部网格、放头用的摄影机和表情曲线。",
   "en": "SMIRK reconstructs 3D faces from monocular images, faithfully capturing extreme, asymmetric and subtle expressions. This card delivers a FLAME head with expression deformation, the camera that places the head, and expression curves."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
